{
  "name": "Distritecno CRM - Webhook Contactos",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "crm-contacto",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook - Nuevo Contacto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "distritecno-crm-contacto"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\n\nconst nombre = body.nombre || '';\nconst tel = body.tel || '';\nconst canal = body.canal || 'WhatsApp';\nconst status = body.status || 'lead';\nconst interes = body.interes || '';\nconst notas = body.notas || '';\nconst fecha = new Date().toLocaleDateString('es-AR', { day: '2-digit', month: 'short', year: 'numeric' });\n\nif (!nombre) {\n  throw new Error('El campo nombre es obligatorio');\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    nombre,\n    tel,\n    canal,\n    status,\n    interes,\n    notas,\n    fecha,\n    monto: body.monto || '',\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "validate-data",
      "name": "Validar y limpiar datos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "TU_SPREADSHEET_ID_ACA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Contactos",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Nombre": "={{ $json.nombre }}",
            "Teléfono": "={{ $json.tel }}",
            "Canal": "={{ $json.canal }}",
            "Estado": "={{ $json.status }}",
            "Interés": "={{ $json.interes }}",
            "Notas": "={{ $json.notas }}",
            "Monto": "={{ $json.monto }}",
            "Fecha": "={{ $json.fecha }}"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-append",
      "name": "Guardar en Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: true, mensaje: 'Contacto guardado correctamente', nombre: $('Validar y limpiar datos').first().json.nombre }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-ok",
      "name": "Responder OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: $execution.error?.message || 'Error desconocido' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      },
      "id": "respond-error",
      "name": "Responder Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [900, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CRM Distritecno - Endpoint de contactos\n\n**Webhook URL (producción):**\n`POST /webhook/crm-contacto`\n\n**Body esperado (JSON):**\n```json\n{\n  \"nombre\": \"Carlos Méndez\",\n  \"tel\": \"+549 11 1234-5678\",\n  \"canal\": \"WhatsApp\",\n  \"status\": \"lead\",\n  \"interes\": \"Samsung A55\",\n  \"notas\": \"Consultó por precio\",\n  \"monto\": 85000\n}\n```\n\n**Importante:** Reemplazá `TU_SPREADSHEET_ID_ACA` en el nodo de Sheets con el ID real de tu planilla.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Instrucciones",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 500]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook - Nuevo Contacto": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validar y limpiar datos",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validar y limpiar datos": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Guardar en Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Guardar en Google Sheets": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Responder OK",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "tags": ["crm", "distritecno", "contactos"]
}
